From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Nguyen <tienthong2004@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:40:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/15] imsservice: Make call settings over Ut work

On Android 10 call forwarding, call waiting and call barring go to the
IMS stack's Ut (XCAP) interface while VoLTE is registered. They all
failed with "turn on the radio":

- samsung-ims-patches made ImsMmtelFeature.getUtInterface() return an
  empty AOSP ImsUtImplBase. Hand Android the IImsUt the stack serves
  itself (Samsung's ImsUtImpl).
- The XCAP APN lookup filters on Samsung's per-slot carriers column
  current1, which AOSP lacks (SQLiteException). Drop the filter; the
  query is already limited to the SIM's APNs.
- The XCAP PDN is requested with NET_CAPABILITY_XCAP, which Android 10
  maps to no APN type. Request NET_CAPABILITY_CBS instead;
  SamsungImsHelper gives the SIM's XCAP APN type "xcap,cbs".

tools/imsservice/fix_ut.py applies the changes. gen_xcap_apns.py
generates the device tree's XCAP APN table from Samsung CSCs.

Assisted-by: LLM
